Executando a instrução SQL: 

        SELECT 
            a.id_aviso AS idAviso,
            a.titulo,
            a.descricao,
            a.fk_usuario,
            u.id_usuario AS idUsuario,
            u.nome_usuario AS nome,
            u.email AS email
        FROM aviso a
            INNER JOIN usuario u
                ON a.fk_usuario = u.id_usuario;
    
